{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068730/extras/52846c869a3e618021246bf5866d1b64.poster.avif?t=1759607242\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068730/extras/52846c869a3e618021246bf5866d1b64.webm?t=1759607242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068730/extras/52846c869a3e618021246bf5866d1b64.mp4?t=1759607242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Once, there was an honorable samurai in the service of the Shogun, but by night, he transformed into an artist painting forbidden desires with his brush. When a shunga artwork depicting the Shogun\u2019s sister leaked beyond the palace walls, a great scandal erupted. Stripped of his rank and expelled from the Shogun\u2019s service, he became a ronin. The Shogun remained silent\u2026 but Kuroda Nobumasa, the powerful daimyo of the Ashina region, would not forgive this disgrace. Swearing vengeance in the name of honor, Nobumasa sent shinobi assassins after him.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into feudal Japan and forge your own path. In a world adorned with breathtaking East Asian landscapes and intricate atmospheres, mystery awaits at every turn. This game offers a bold and liberated experience filled with adult content, allowing you to explore your passions and push your boundaries. Customize your character and witness the beginning of the story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068730/extras/9fe862f4ed662e27bfcf48211161ac75.poster.avif?t=1759607242\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068730/extras/9fe862f4ed662e27bfcf48211161ac75.webm?t=1759607242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068730/extras/9fe862f4ed662e27bfcf48211161ac75.mp4?t=1759607242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OPEN-WORLD ADULT RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to experience the prologue section of the game and explore the open world customized for the demo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE YOUR CHARACTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own samurai with the character creator. Your choices shape the story and dialogues.\u00a0Enjoy a freeform gameplay experience. Use the character creator to design your own Ronin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068730/extras/d4e4e8dafc67645a2abea2989c861508.poster.avif?t=1759607242\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068730/extras/d4e4e8dafc67645a2abea2989c861508.webm?t=1759607242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068730/extras/d4e4e8dafc67645a2abea2989c861508.mp4?t=1759607242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068730?t=1759607242","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4068730?t=1759607242","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068730/8a2dba61ebcb0ad5537f422fbbf2